"P1663929137" "Story Description"

// ToolTip :
"P360013978" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Story Description</color><br>The description of the story. This is the description you want yourself and others to see when selecting your Story from the mission browser window. Attempt to make it as clear and succinct as possible."









// Name :
"P372082671" "Story Contact"

// ToolTip :
"P1105123978" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Story Contact</color><br>Here is where you pick the point of contact for your story. The contact acts as the mission giver and is generally tied to the overall story in some fashion."




// Name :
"P3042836257" "Contact Name"

// ToolTip :
"P1459131317" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Contact Name</color><br>The name of your contact. It's displayed above their head."









// Name :
"P1738593806" "Contact Type"

// ToolTip :
"P400765766" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Contact Type</color><br>Contacts are broken up into different categories to make them easier to find.<br><br>Standard Contacts:<color SandyBrown> Characters that are already being used as contacts in the game.<i> Statesman, Ashley McKnight, Jim Temblor, etc.</i><br></color><br>Enemy Groups:<color SandyBrown> Characters that are associated with an existing enemy group.<i> Frostfire from the Outcast, a Rikti monkey from the Rikti, Dr. Vahzilok from the Vahzilok, etc.</i><br></color><br>Objects:<color SandyBrown> Entities that are not people can also be used as contacts.<i> A body bag, a computer desk, a bulletin board, a radio etc.</i><br></color>"






