"P3926663192" "Giant Monster Enemy Group"

// ToolTip :
"P2735084662" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Giant Monster Enemy Group</color><br>The enemy group of which Giant Monster boss is a part. Selecting an enemy group allows you to choose the specific boss you want for this goal. <br><br>Example:<color SandyBrown><br><i>Selecting 5th Column allows you to then choose Requiem as a specific enemy.</i></color>"










