"P2901991269" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Difficulty</color><br>The level of difficulty of the enemies with the Giant Monster, not the difficulty of the Giant Monster itself. Increasing the difficulty adds enemies of higher ranks into the Giant Monster spawn, more lieutenants as opposed to minions or more bosses as opposed to lieutenants, etc."



























