// Name :
"P3002092639" "Captive Starting Animation"

// ToolTip :
"P3537919989" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Captive Starting Animation</color><br>The animation of the captive when first encountered.<br><br>Note: Regretfully, not all animations work for all entities."







