// ToolTip :
"P3570720553" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Quantity</color><br>The amount of this specific type of escort you want to in your mission. This will make multiple copies of the person in the mission.<br><br>Note that if you use this option, the name, enemy groups, model of the person, description, placement, all of it will be exactly the same. Traditionally, this is only useful for the more generic people you want to have in a map to fill out the space."





















// ToolTip :
"P489844021" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Group</color><br>The enemy group surrounding the person. In most cases this is the enemy group holding the person hostage in the case of a hero mission or trying to protect the person in the case of a villain kidnap mission."



























// Name :
