// ToolTip :
"P2835976262" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Escort Placement</color><br>The location on the map that the escort will spawn.<br><br>Any: <color SandyBrown>The game will pick a random location from Front, Middle or Back to appear.</color><br>Back: <color SandyBrown>The person will spawn in the back of the mission map.</color><br>Front: <color SandyBrown>The person will spawn in the front of the map.</color><br>Middle: <color SandyBrown>The person will spawn in the middle of the map.</color>"








// ToolTip :
