"P1794323481" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Arrival Behavior</color><br>What the escort does when they arrive at their destined location.<br><br>Do Nothing: <color SandyBrown>The person will simply stand there and do nothing.</color><br>Follow: <color SandyBrown>Once the person is escorted to their destination they will follow the player.</color><br>Run Away: <color SandyBrown>The person will run away in fear when they reach their location.</color><br>Run To Nearest Door: <color SandyBrown>The person will run away and find the nearest door from which to exit.<br></color>Wander: <color SandyBrown>Upon arrival, the person will begin to wander around the area."


























