"P2780041888" "Lead Escort To Objective Text (Plural)"

// ToolTip :
"P307907438" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Lead Escort To Objective Text (Plural)</color><br>Once a person is rescued, this is the text that display in the navigation window telling the player what to do. Since this is the plural option, this text will only show up when you have more than one of the same type of objective in your mission. A number will be automatically placed in front of the navigation text so format your text appropriately.<br><br>Example:<color SandyBrown>5 Hostages to lead out<br>2 Outcasts to escape with<br>9 PTA Moms to escort out</color>"








// Name :
"P937285277" "Lead To Objective Text (Singular)"

// ToolTip :
"P650893433" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Lead To Objective Text (Singular)</color><br>Once a person is rescued, this is the text that display in the navigation window telling the player what to do. Since this is the singular option, this text will only show up when you have one objective of this type in your mission. Unlike the plural version, no number will be placed in front of the navigation text so if you want a number you must add it.<br><br>Example:<color SandyBrown>Last hostage to lead out<br>Only 1 Outcast remaining<br>1 PTA Moms to get to safety</color>"







// Name :
"P717192560" "Escort Completed Text"

// ToolTip :
"P2430100456" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Person Completed Text</color><br>This text displays in the chat window once the Escort goal is complete.<br><br>Example:<br><color SandyBrown>You have rescued all the hostages. Return to your contact for further instruction.</color>"






// Name :
"P3121339600" "Way Point Text"

// ToolTip :
"P42939288" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Way Point Text</color><br>The short text that appears on the mini-map telling the player where to take the person once they're rescued."






// ToolTip :
"P3731237865" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Unaware Dialog</color><br>Dialog spoken by the enemies surrounding the person before they are aware of the player character.<br><br>Example:<br><color SandyBrown><i>We're going to get a lot of money for you.</i></color>"









// ToolTip :
"P1637937006" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Group Attack Dialog</color><br>Dialog spoken by the enemies surrounding the person once they are aware of the player character.<br><br>Example:<br><color SandyBrown><i>I guess we're not getting that ransom after all.</i></color>"







// Name :
"P768808278" "Escort Inactive Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P988034759" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Person Inactive Dialog</color><br>Dialog spoken by the person before he/she sees the player."







// Name :
"P273237353" "Escort Active Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P592402462" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Person Active Dialog</color><br>Dialog spoken by the person upon seeing the player."







// Name :
"P2466599657" "Escort Rescued Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P2796698154" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Person Rescued Dialog</color><br>Dialog spoken by the person upon being rescued by the player."







// Name :
"P3213700262" "Escort Stranded Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P2864937682" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Person Stranded Dialog</color><br>Dialog spoken by the person upon being stranded by the player. People are stranded when a player gets too far away and the person can't find them."








// Name :
"P721168957" "Escort Reacquired Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P2034984994" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Person Reacquired Dialog</color><br>Dialog spoken by the person upon player reacquiring them from being stranded. "







// Name :
"P3533653044" "Escort Arrived Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P149410370" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Person Arrived Dialog</color><br>Dialog said by the person upon arrival of their destined location."








// Name :
"P625141362" "Escort Dealt Damage"

// ToolTip :
"P3792402957" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Escort Dealt Damage</color><br>The dialog spoken by the Escort the first time damage is dealt.<br><br>Example:<br><i><color SandyBrown>You hit like a girl... a really strong girl.</i></color>"







// Name :
"P215547948" "Escort 3/4 Health"

// ToolTip :
"P3312172418" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Escort At 3/4 Health</color><br>The dialog spoken when the Escort is at 3/4 health.<br><br>Example:<br><i><color SandyBrown>These guys aren't pushovers</i></color>"







// Name :
"P3460553110" "Escort 1/2 Health"

// ToolTip :
"P1198353575" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Ally 1/2 Health</color><br>The dialog spoken when the Escort is at 1/2 health.<br><br>Example:<br><i><color SandyBrown>Are you even helping?</i></color>"







// Name :
"P137154577" "Escort 1/4 Health"

// ToolTip :
"P3940815234" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Ally 1/4 Health</color><br>The dialog spoken when the Escort is at 1/4 health.<br><br>Example:<br><i><color SandyBrown>I might not make it...</i></color>"







// Name :
"P714802176" "Escort Is Defeated"



// ToolTip :
"P159908299" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Ally Is Defeated</color><br>The dialog spoken when the Escort is defeated.<br><br>Example:<br><i><color SandyBrown>Game over man, game over.</i></color>"






// Name :
"P3111865493" "Escort Defeated Enemy Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P2290644949" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Ally Defeated Enemy Dialog</color><br>The dialog spoken when the Escort defeats an enemy.<br><br>Example:<br><i><color SandyBrown>Another one for me, but then again who is keeping score?</i></color>"










// ToolTip :
"P3061597896" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Escort Animations</color><br>Set animations for the person as well as the enemy group here. These are not required for this mission goal to be playable."













// Name :
"P1135676300" "Escort Starting Animation"

// ToolTip :
"P2039318298" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Starting Animation</color><br>The animation of the person when first encountered.<br><br>Note: Regretfully, not all animations work for all entities."








// Name :
"P3041163085" "Escort Rescue Animation"

// ToolTip :
"P1294295586" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Rescue Animation</color><br>The animation played by the person when rescued.<br><br>Note: Regretfully, not all animations work for all entities."








// Name :
"P3264753744" "Escort Stranded Animation"

// ToolTip :
"P4206677526" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Person Stranded Animation</color><br>The animation played by the escort when stranded.<br><br>Note: Regretfully, not all animations work for all entities."








// Name :
"P3679917694" "Escort Arrival Animation"

// ToolTip :
"P2155552670" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Arrival Animation</color><br>The animation played by the person on arrival to their destined location.<br><br>Note: Regretfully, not all animations work for all entities."









// Name :
"P3503363335" "Escort Delivered Clue"


// ToolTip :
"P3830557233" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Escort Delivered Clue</color><br>This clue is granted to the player once they've rescued or completed the mission goal involving this escort. Clues are helpful to progress the story, giving more information directly related to this person."






















// DisplayName :
"P339022338" "Battle"

// Tooltip :
"P371538363" "<color DeepSkyBlue>A Battle</color><br>A group of enemies that will fight each other."








// Name :
"P1416161895" "Battle Name"

// ToolTip :
"P2521536834" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Battle Name</color><br>The name of the battle. This name is for your use only. The players will never see it.<br><br>Example:<br><color SandyBrown>Front Outcast Battle</color>"








// Name :
"P3864483534" "Enemy Group One Type"












// Name :
"P2431482138" "Enemy Group One"

// ToolTip :
"P715072222" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Group One</color><br>Battles are broken up into two groups: Enemy Group One and Enemy Group Two. Here you set the enemy type for group one."




























// Name :
"P2489024968" "Enemy Group Two Type"












// Name :
"P4216026509" "Enemy Group Two"

// ToolTip :
"P1953873844" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Group Two</color><br>Battles are broken up into two groups: Enemy Group One and Enemy Group Two. Here you set the enemy type for group two."





























// ToolTip :
"P2287222959" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Battle Settings</color><br>These settings are not required for the mission to be playable."














// ToolTip :
"P3730490843" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Quantity</color><br>The amount of this specific type of battle you want to in your mission. This will make multiple copies of the battle in the mission.<br><br>Note that if you use this option, the enemy group, dialog and placement will be exactly the same. Traditionally, this is only useful for the more generic spawns you want to have in a map to fill out the space."







// Name :
"P1485559723" "Battle Placement"

// ToolTip :
"P2866082350" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Battle Placement</color><br>The location on the map that the battle will spawn.<br><br>Any: <color SandyBrown>The game will pick a random location from Front, Middle or Back to appear.</color><br>Back: <color SandyBrown>The battle will spawn in the back of the mission map.</color><br>Front: <color SandyBrown>The battle will spawn in the front of the map.</color><br>Middle: <color SandyBrown>The battle will spawn in the middle of the map.</color>"







// Name :
"P499607594" "Battle Difficulty"

// ToolTip :
"P630241690" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Battle Difficulty</color><br>The difficulty of the enemies in the Battle. Increasing the difficulty adds enemies of higher ranks into the patrol, more lieutenants as opposed to minions or more bosses as opposed to lieutenants, etc."








// Name :
"P1017036025" "Battle Alignment"

// ToolTip :
"P2960066506" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Battle Alignment</color><br><i>Set the alignment of the battle on your map.<br><br>Both Groups are Enemies: <color SandyBrown>Both groups are enemies and will fight each other. They may defeat one another before the players have a chance to engage them. However, those remaining will also fight the player.<br>Group One is Ally: <color SandyBrown>The first enemy group is your ally. They will aid you in fighting enemy group two as well as any other enemies that get within the area.</color><br>Group Two is Ally: <color SandyBrown>The second enemy group is your ally. They will aid you in fighting enemy group one as well as any other enemies that get within the area.</color>"









// Name :
"P3471171474" "Battle Dialog"


// ToolTip :
"P2399018683" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Battle Dialog</color><br>Dialog that you can add to a battle, but it's not required for this mission goal to be playable."




// Name :
"P107527868" "Enemy Group One Inactive Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P1392764304" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Group One Inactive Dialog</color><br>The dialog spoken by one of the members of the battle.<br><br>Example: <color SandyBrown><i>You think you can disrespect the Skulls and get away with it?</i></color>"







// Name :
"P3788032800" "Enemy Group One Active Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P665887633" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Group One Active Dialog</color><br>The dialog spoken by one of the members of the battle.<br><br>Example: <color SandyBrown><i>Did you call for backup? Afraid you couldn't take the Skulls down by yourself?</i></color>"







// Name :
"P1532069174" "Enemy Group Two Inactive Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P1295490279" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Group One Inactive Dialog</color><br>The dialog spoken by one of the members of the battle.<br><br>Example: <color SandyBrown><i>We're the Outcasts, we don't care about any of you.</i></color>"







// Name :
"P524290833" "Enemy Group Two Active Dialog"

// ToolTip :
"P3290894015" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Enemy Group One Active Dialog</color><br>The dialog spoken by one of the members of the battle.<br><br>Example: <color SandyBrown><i>You're the last thing we need.</i></color>"













// Tooltip :
"P4279261845" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Defeat All Enemies</color><br>This mission goal has two options.<br><br>Everything on the map: <color SandyBrown>Requires the player to defeat all of the enemies on the map.</color><br>Everything in the last room: <color SandyBrown>Requires the player to defeat just the enemies in the last room of the map."









// Name :
"P3895331187" "Defeat..."

// ToolTip :
"P4085205499" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Defeat...</color><br>Select the defeat option that best suits your mission.<br><br>...everything on the map: <color SandyBrown>The player must defeat every enemy on the map.</color><br>...everything in the last room: <color SandyBrown>The player is required to just defeat the enemies in the last area or room of the map.</color>"





// DisplayName :
"P206627364" "...everything on the map"





// DisplayName :
"P1697864462" "...everything on the final room"







// Name :
"P4250053062" "Defeat All Enemies Text"


// ToolTip :
"P2492342866" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Defeat All Enemies Text</color><br>Text options for the Defeat All Enemies mission goal."




// Name :
"P1602130955" "Navigation Text"

// ToolTip :
"P28235440" "<color DeepSkyBlue>Navigation Text</color><br>This is the text that appears in the Navigation Window informing the players what it is that they're supposed to do.<br><br>Example:<br><color SandyBrown>Defeat All Enemies</color> or <color SandyBrown>Clear the Warehouse</color>"










